<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσκομ-ίζω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κεκόμικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.):—<i>carry in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόρτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					606
				</span></i>
			; <i>guide in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				951
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>bring in for oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐκ τῶν ἀγρῶν ἐσκομίζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.13
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				1.117
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκομίζεσθαι εἰς τὰ τείχη</span>”
				<i>take shelter in..,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.100
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειδὰν εἰσκομισθῶσιν πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					242
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν σῖτον ἐκ τῆς χώρας -κομισθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.331.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς εἰς ταὐτὸ διὰ ταὐτοῦ -ομένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.699f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>import</i> into a discussion, <i>introduce,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο λύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>in Cat.</u>
					139.30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
